// Inherit the parent event
event_inherited();

array_push(_dialogs, $"I was just on my way back... Oh, sorry, I thought you were someone else. Do you need something?");
array_push(_dialogs, $"You know, I grew up in a town just like this. I would tantrum and rage as a teen about the tiny box I felt I'd been forced into. Telling anyone who would listen, and even those who wouldn't, how I'd escape it some day. And I did...");
array_push(_dialogs, $"But now that I'm a little older, every time I'm in a similar town, like this one, I'm reminded how much I miss the ocean. Traffic doesn't quite hit the same as being able to hear the crash of the waves through your bedroom window...");
array_push(_dialogs, $"I'll send a post out on my business page right now. I have quite a following, so you should see an uptick in your engagement.");